   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The four tones",
   "texto": [
    "**mā** keeps a high tone; **má** goes up; **mǎ** goes down and goes up again; **mà** falls. The unmarked syllable, like **ma**, has a neutral tone and is said to be brief.",
    "The letters **q, x, zh, ch, sh** do not sound as in Spanish: **q** approaches «ch», **x** to a soft «sh» and **zh** to a sound «ch»."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Syllas and spaces",
   "texto": [
    "A word of several characters can form a single unit, such as **你好** (hello). In these lessons we put a space between words, not between syllables of the same word.",
    "**他** and **她** are pronounced equally: tā. The writing distinguishes «He» and «her.», although speaking does not hear that difference."
   ]
